"program_narrative": "Program PORTUPDT is a batch program that applies field updates to existing portfolio master records. It opens the indexed PORTFOLIO-FILE for update (random access by PORT-KEY) and reads the sequential UPDATE-FILE record by record until end of file. For each update record it reads the portfolio with the same key (portfolio ID and account number) and, depending on the action code, replaces the portfolio status ('S'), the client name ('N') or the total value ('V') with UPDT-NEW-VALUE, then rewrites the portfolio record. Successful rewrites are counted as updates; portfolios not found and failed rewrites are counted as errors and reported on the console. At the end it closes both files, displays the update and error counts and sets RETURN-CODE from WS-RETURN-CODE (8 when a file failed to open, otherwise 0). Error conditions handled: open failure (reported, return code 8), record not found, rewrite failure; the open-failure path does not stop the main loop and is flagged for review.",
